# Public GitHub OAuth App client id. Enable "Device flow" on the OAuth App.
# Local development: copy this file to `.env.local` and fill the value.
# Vercel: add GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID in Project Settings → Environment
# Variables (Production and Preview), then redeploy. `.env.local` is not
# uploaded by Vercel. No client secret is used.
GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional alias accepted by the Vercel functions for existing deployments.
# VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
